Subject: [PATCH 54/56] test: add signet_pqchallenge_tests and its vectors

signet_pq.py gains the challenge of a key and the solution that spends it,
computed over the BIP 325 virtual transactions as contrib/signet/miner does;
test/util/generate_signet_pqchallenge_tests.py writes a block signed that way.
The unit tests check the derived challenge, the solution, what the rule
rejects, the option, and that a node without it takes any solution.
